# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Frontend (exposed to the browser — VITE_ prefix)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Supabase project URL & anon key (Project Settings → API in the Supabase dashboard).
# When unset, the app falls back to localStorage-backed auth and storage so dev still works.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=""
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=""

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Server-only (Vercel serverless functions, never exposed to browser)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Amadeus self-service API (https://developers.amadeus.com).
# Free test environment; create a Self-Service app to get key + secret.
# When unset, /api/search returns deterministic mock results.
AMADEUS_API_KEY=""
AMADEUS_API_SECRET=""
